# Moddy Arena: a battle lost. The player starts a battle, walks into the first wave without fighting back, and the
# husks knock him out; on his own he is every fighter, so the battle is lost at once. He comes back in the prep room (the arena's home), is told in plain
# words, and the arena is tidied: the wave's mobs are gone, and what he dropped is carried to the prep room for him.
@intent a player who is knocked out in a battle loses it, comes back in the prep room, and the arena is tidied
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
# something of his own, to show that being knocked out in a battle loses him nothing
give @s minecraft:iron_sword

@step he starts a battle with the button
# a couple of steps toward the gate, then the stone button beside it
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 8t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 2.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s

@step wave 1 comes and he goes in
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
# he opens the gate in the shared wall and walks through it, into the arena
@aim pos 0.5 64.5 16.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 30t
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @s[z=-15,dz=30]
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@shot in-the-arena

@step the husks knock him out
# he does not fight back: three husks on Normal take his 20 health in well under a minute
@expect chat knocked out or left within 180s
@wait 2s
@shot lost

@step back in the prep room, and the arena is tidied
# he respawns at the arena's home, the prep room
@assert execute if entity @s[x=-4,y=63,z=17,dx=8,dy=3,dz=8]
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 15s
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=!minecraft:player,x=-17,y=60,z=-17,dx=34,dy=40,dz=34]
# what he dropped when he was knocked out was carried to the prep room, where he stands, and he has it again
@repeat 40 until execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:iron_sword
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:iron_sword
@aim look 180 12
@wait 1s
@shot back-in-the-prep-room
